    "content": "<p>Summer is in full swing, and brought with it events and prizes for the War Robots: Frontiers community. Check out the contests and entries so far, and join in on the fun!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Summer Community Events</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>Social Share Challenge: Volta Summer Postcard</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In honor of the summer season, we asked you to place the Titan Volta in a vacation scene, and share the good vibes on social media.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Community gave Volta a fantastic holiday, and we want to showcase a few of the relaxing entries. See you at the pool!</p>\r\n<spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>iRbz</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/1.png\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Capaxe93</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/2.jpg\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>xROLLxTIDEx</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/3.jpg\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ZeuSACE</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/4.png\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Hybrid</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/5.jpg\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Tr-87pRo</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/6.jpg\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>WeTheTired</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Postcards/7.jpg\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem>\r\n\r\n<h3>Social Share Challenge: Spearhead Build Showcase</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>For this summer challenge, we tasked players to share their favorite War Robot Build for the Spearhead game mode. Surf&rsquo;s up!</p>\r\n<news-gallery>\r\n<div class=\"news-gallery__inner\">\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/1.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/2.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/3.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/4.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/5.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/6.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Build/7.png\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</news-gallery>\r\n\r\n<h3>Social Share Challenge: Gaming Setup Showcase</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Summer isn&rsquo;t all about trips to the beach, it&rsquo;s also about gaming! This challenge was for players to share their gaming setup for War Robots: Frontiers. Now that&rsquo;s what I call a real vacation!</p>\r\n<news-gallery>\r\n<div class=\"news-gallery__inner\">\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Setup/%E3%80%8E%20MDR%20%E3%80%8F.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Setup/dragon864789.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Setup/xROLLxTIDEx.png\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</news-gallery>\r\n\r\n<h2>Sticker Contest: Enter Before August 24!</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Remember, it&rsquo;s not too late to get in on the summer fun. Create a brand-new in-game cosmetic Sticker for War Robots: Frontiers until <strong>August 24 </strong>for the chance to win awesome prizes and have your Sticker added to the game!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can submit your design via <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a> or <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a> by tagging <strong>@WRFrontiers</strong> and using <strong>#WRFStickers, </strong>or you can submit it to our dedicated <strong>sticker-creation-contest</strong> <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> channel. Check out more details <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/news/255\">here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Sticker%20Contest/1.png\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Sticker%20Contest/2.jpg\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Sticker%20Contest/3.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Sticker%20Contest/5.png\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/08/261-CommunitySpotlight/Sticker%20Contest/6.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n<hr /></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest contests and community events!</p>",
